          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">
            Ingen dyre abonnementer på 1500 kr/måned, ingen blackout-sperrer og ingen bindingstid.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#08080f] border border-white/5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#8b5cf6]/10 text-[#a78bfa] flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Ingen Blackouts</h3>
